# Close Circle

A friends and family social app where people can share life updates, view wishlists, send holiday cards, and create shared memories together.

## Overview

Close Circle is a centralized platform for users to document their lives through posts, organize memories by events, and stay connected with loved ones. The platform provides a simple, organized way to share life moments with family and friends.

---

## User Flow & Navigation

### Top Navigation Bar
- **Home** - View personal posts and feed
- **Posts** - View all user posts
- **Categories** - Browse content by category
- **Lists** - Access wishlists and email lists
- **Logout** - Sign out of account

### Left Sidebar (When Logged In)
- User Profile Picture
- **Edit Button** - Allows user to edit their profile
- **Post Button** - Creates a new post (floating action)

### Main Content Area
- Grid/Flex display of all user posts
- Each post shows: cover image, title, category, and creation date
- Click a post to view full details, edit, or delete

---

## MVP Features (Core Functionality)

### 1. User Accounts & Authentication
Users can create accounts and log in securely. Upon login, they are directed to their home page where they can manage their posts and content.

**Features:**
- Email and password login
- Secure password handling
- Session management after login

**Database Tables:** `users`

---

### 2. User Profiles & Customization
Each user has a customizable profile with personal information and photos.

**Features:**
- Profile photo upload
- Bio/about section
- Background color customization
- Email visible to others for contact
- Edit profile button in sidebar

**Database Tables:** `users`, `photos`

---

### 3. Posts & Content Management
Users can create, view, edit, and delete posts about their lives. Posts are the core feature of the platform.

**Features:**
- Create a post with title, description, and category
- View all personal posts on home page in grid/flex layout
- View detailed post page with full content
- Edit post information (title, description, category, photos)
- Delete posts with confirmation dialog
- Timestamps on all posts
- Category assignment for organization

**Database Tables:** `posts`, `photos`, `categories`

---

### 4. Categories
Posts can be organized by categories (e.g., Travel, Family, Hobbies, Work) to help users organize and find content.

**Features:**
- Category dropdown when creating/editing posts
- View all available categories
- Filter posts by category
- Each post has one primary category

**Database Tables:** `categories`

---

## Stretch Goals (Additional Features)

### 5. Guest Book
Other users can leave messages on your profile to share notes, memories, or well-wishes.

**Features:**
- View guestbook section on user profiles
- Write messages on other users' guestbooks
- Messages include author name and timestamp
- Profile owner can see all messages received
- Messages can be edited or deleted by author

**Database Tables:** `guestbook`

---

### 6. Likes on Posts
Users can like posts from family and friends to show appreciation and engagement.

**Features:**
- Like/unlike button on each post
- Like count displayed on post
- Toggle like on and off
- See which posts you've liked

**Database Tables:** `likes`

---

### 7. Event Tags on Posts
Posts can be tagged with events or occasions to help organize shared family memories.

**Features:**
- Tag posts with events (e.g., "Family Reunion 2024", "Grandma's Birthday")
- Event tags include name and year
- Create new event tags when editing/creating posts
- Filter and view posts by event tag
- Organize profile timeline by events

**Database Tables:** `eventTags`

---

### 8. Wishlists
Users can create wishlists to share gift ideas with family and friends for birthdays and holidays.

**Features:**
- Add wishlist items with name, description, and Amazon link
- Wishlist displayed on user profile
- Friends and family can view and use for gift ideas
- Edit and delete wishlist items
- Optional item photos

**Database Tables:** `wishlists`

---

### 9. Email List for Cards
Users can maintain a list of email addresses for sending holiday and greeting cards to family and friends.

**Features:**
- Add email addresses to personal email list
- Include contact name for each email
- Can include people without Close Circle accounts
- Use for Christmas cards, birthday cards, and other greetings
- Accessible from Lists navigation button
- Edit and delete email list entries

**Database Tables:** `emailList`

---

### 10. Notifications (Future Feature)
Users will receive notifications for interactions on their content. To be implemented after MVP completion.

**Features:**
- Notify when someone likes a post
- Notify when someone comments on a post
- Notify when someone leaves a guestbook message
- Notification center with read/unread status
- Click notification to navigate to related content

**Database Tables:** `notifications`

---

## Future Features (Post-MVP)

- **Meetups** - Users can post meetups (spontaneous or planned) and others can request to join and receive notifications
- **Multiple photos per post** - Enhanced photo uploads with file organization
- **Advanced profile customization** - Additional customization options
- **Real-time updates** - Live notifications and updates
- **Comments on posts** - Discussion threads on posts
- **Photo albums and galleries** - Organized photo collections
- **Sharing with specific friends or groups** - Control who sees what

---

## Database Schema

### users
Core user account information

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique user identifier |
| name | VARCHAR | User's full name |
| email | VARCHAR UNIQUE | User's email address (for login) |
| password | VARCHAR | Hashed password |
| location | VARCHAR | Optional location/city |
| bio | TEXT | User's about/bio section |
| profilePhoto | VARCHAR | URL to profile picture |
| backgroundColor | VARCHAR | User's chosen background color |
| createdAt | TIMESTAMP | Account creation timestamp |

---

### posts
User posts/updates about their lives

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique post identifier |
| title | VARCHAR | Post title |
| body | TEXT | Post description/content |
| userId | INT FK | Foreign key to users (post author) |
| categoryId | INT FK | Foreign key to categories |
| createdAt | TIMESTAMP | Post creation timestamp |
| updatedAt | TIMESTAMP | Last modified timestamp |

---

### categories
Categories for organizing posts

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique category identifier |
| title | VARCHAR | Category name (Travel, Family, Hobbies, etc.) |

---

### photos
Images attached to posts

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique photo identifier |
| postId | INT FK | Foreign key to posts |
| photoUrl | VARCHAR | URL to the image |
| uploadedAt | TIMESTAMP | Upload timestamp |

---

### guestbook
Messages left on user profiles

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique message identifier |
| userId | INT FK | Foreign key to users (profile owner) |
| profileUserId | INT FK | Foreign key to users (message author) |
| message | TEXT | Message text |
| createdAt | TIMESTAMP | Message creation timestamp |
| updatedAt | TIMESTAMP | Last edited timestamp |

---

### eventTags
Tags for shared family/friend occasions on posts

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique tag identifier |
| postId | INT FK | Foreign key to posts |
| tagName | VARCHAR | Event name (Family Reunion, etc.) |
| tagYear | INT | Year of event |
| createdAt | TIMESTAMP | Tag creation timestamp |

---

### likes
Tracks which users liked which posts

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique like identifier |
| userId | INT FK | Foreign key to users (person who liked) |
| postId | INT FK | Foreign key to posts (post being liked) |

---

### wishlists
Wish list items for users

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique wishlist item identifier |
| userId | INT FK | Foreign key to users |
| itemName | VARCHAR | Name of item (required) |
| itemDescription | TEXT | Description of item (optional) |
| amazonUrl | VARCHAR | Link to Amazon product (optional) |
| addedAt | TIMESTAMP | Timestamp when added |

---

### emailList
Emails for sending cards and messages

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique email entry identifier |
| userId | INT FK | Foreign key to users |
| email | VARCHAR | Email address |
| name | VARCHAR | Contact name |
| addedAt | TIMESTAMP | Timestamp when added |

---

### notifications (Future)
Alerts for user interactions

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique notification identifier |
| userId | INT FK | Foreign key to users (recipient) |
| type | VARCHAR | Type (like, comment, guestbook) |
| message | TEXT | Notification message text |
| relatedPostId | INT FK | Foreign key to posts (if applicable) |
| isRead | BOOLEAN | Read status flag |
| createdAt | TIMESTAMP | Notification creation timestamp |

---

### meetups (Future)
Posts about places users are going

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique meetup identifier |
| createdByUserId | INT FK | Foreign key to users (organizer) |
| title | VARCHAR | Meetup title |
| description | TEXT | Meetup description |
| location | VARCHAR | Physical location |
| type | VARCHAR | Type (spontaneous or planned) |
| scheduledDate | TIMESTAMP | Date and time of meetup |
| status | VARCHAR | Status (planned, confirmed, cancelled) |
| createdAt | TIMESTAMP | Timestamp when created |

---

### meetupAttendees (Future)
Tracks who wants to join meetups

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | INT PK | Unique attendance record identifier |
| meetupId | INT FK | Foreign key to meetups |
| userId | INT FK | Foreign key to users (attendee) |
| status | VARCHAR | Attendance status (attending, maybe, not attending) |
| joinedAt | TIMESTAMP | Timestamp when RSVP was made |

---

## Implementation Priority

### High Priority (MVP)
- [ ] User authentication and login flow
- [ ] Create, read, update, delete (CRUD) posts
- [ ] User profiles with basic customization
- [ ] Categories for post organization

### Medium Priority (Stretch Goals)
- [ ] Likes on posts
- [ ] Guestbook messages
- [ ] Event tags
- [ ] Wishlists
- [ ] Email lists

### Lower Priority (Future)
- [ ] Notifications system
- [ ] Meetups feature
- [ ] Advanced profile customization
- [ ] Multiple photo uploads per post
- [ ] Real-time updates

